ss="font-bold text-cyan-400">C.</span><span><strong>Priority Broadcasts:</strong> Instant Urgent / Warning screen flash announcements.</span></li><li class="p-2 bg-slate-800/80 rounded border border-slate-700 flex items-start gap-2"><span class="font-bold text-cyan-400">D.</span><span><strong>Stage Control:</strong> Toggle "Happening Now" agenda status across all clients.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section></main>
